      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Interactions between indomethacin (INDO) and paracetamol (PAR) with regard to their anti-inflammatory, anti-pyretic and analgesic activities were studied in rats. The anti-inflammatory and anti-pyretic effects of INDO and PAR were additive. Although antagonism was observed in the analgesic test, the effect of the combination was not inferior to that of PAR alone."},
